<h2>SHIPPING SMALL PACKAGE</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Orders ship on the next business day after the payment has cleared.</li>
  <li>Orders placed on weekends or holidays ship the next business day.</li>
  <li>We ship via USPS, UPS, or FedEx, and reserve the right to select or change carriers as needed.</li>
  <li>Shipping rates are based on the destination ZIP code and apply to the lower 48 states only.</li>
  <li>Expedited shipping may be available at an additional cost. Buyers must contact us before purchasing to confirm availability. All expedited shipping fees are non-refundable.</li>
  <li>We do not control international shipping costs, taxes, or customs fees.</li>
  <li>Local pickup is available for all items. Buyers must contact us in advance to ensure the order is prepared.</li>
</ul>
<h2>FREIGHT SHIPPING</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Large items (including but not limited to engines, transmissions, body panels, axles, exhausts, interiors, cradles, etc.) ship via freight.</li>
  <li>Freight orders ship within 1 business days after cleared payment and receipt of required delivery information.</li>
  <li>Freight transit times may take up to 7 business days.</li>
  <li>Locations without a dock or forklift require a liftgate service, which must be disclosed at time of purchase.</li>
  <li>Residential freight delivery must be quoted prior to purchase and typically costs significantly more than commercial delivery.</li>
  <li>Buyers have the option to pick freight from a local freight terminal. If you opt for this option we will provide you with the location of a terminal closest to you. Buyer must show up with proper equipment and identification to pick up the shipment.</li>
  <li>A valid phone number and business name are required with all freight shipments.</li>
  <li>If you do not meet the commercial delivery criteria, you must contact us to obtain an accurate shipping quote.</li>
  <li>In the event that the buyer does not respond to freight carrier attempts to call and schedule, or misses his delivery appointment buyer will be responsible for redelivery fee which range between $100-$300 depending on the size and weight of the package.</li>
  <li>All freight shipments must be unpackaged and thoroughly inspected before signing for delivery.</li>
  <li>If an item arrives damaged, you must refuse delivery for us to be able to refund you. If you accept and sign for delivery your order will no longer be eligible for a refund.</li>
</ul>
